的红色蝴蝶结。下身搭配英伦风格格纹百褶裙，整体色调协调而富有层次。白色过膝袜与黑色圆头小皮鞋相互搭配，使整体造型更具学院气息。衣物细节丰富，蕾丝、褶边与蝴蝶结等元素共同营造出甜美可爱的氛围。","sender":"me","time":"23:26","timestamp":1782055579190,"replyTo":null,"rawContent":"二次元少女，身高152cm，体型娇小玲珑。拥有一头精心打理的栗色双马尾，整齐的齐刘海下是一张精致的心形小脸。发尾微微内卷，增添了几分甜美与活泼。肌肤白皙细腻，宛如瓷娃娃般光洁。一双粉色的大眼睛清澈明亮，神情温柔而略显胆怯，给人柔软无害的印象。\n整体气质偏向日系学院风与轻洛丽塔风格，精致而优雅。身形纤细轻盈，举止文静，带着大小姐般的良好教养与少女感。\n服装方面，她穿着一件白色蕾丝花边翻领短袖衬衫，领口系着精致的红色蝴蝶结。下身搭配英伦风格格纹百褶裙，整体色调协调而富有层次。白色过膝袜与黑色圆头小皮鞋相互搭配，使整体造型更具学院气息。衣物细节丰富，蕾丝、褶边与蝴蝶结等元素共同营造出甜美可爱的氛围。","isHtml":false,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":12274},{"id":1782054244623,"text":"{\"prompt\":\"A stylized anime illustration of a petite Japanese-inspired schoolgirl character with a gentle, innocent, and refined aesthetic. She has a delicate heart-shaped face, fair porcelain-like skin, and large clear pink eyes that give a soft, timid expression. Her chestnut-brown hair is styled into neatly arranged twin ponytails with straight-cut bangs, with slightly curled ends that add a lively, cute feel.\\n\\nHer overall appearance blends Japanese academy fashion with a light, elegant frilly style. She wears a white short-sleeved blouse with lace-edged collar details and a neatly tied red ribbon bow at the neckline. The outfit is paired with a plaid pleated skirt in coordinated tones, white over-knee socks, and black round-toe leather shoes. The clothing features detailed textures such as lace trim, folds, and ribbons, creating a polished and aesthetically pleasing school uniform look.\\n\\nThe character stands in a soft, neutral pose, conveying a quiet, well-mannered, slightly shy but graceful personality. The art style is high-quality anime illustration with clean linework, soft lighting, and a pastel, airy color palette. The background is minimal and unobtrusive to emphasize the character design.\",\"size\":\"1024x1024\",\"n\":1}","rawContent":"{\"prompt\":\"A stylized anime illustration of a petite Japanese-inspired schoolgirl ch